    slug: "ayurveda-inflammation",
    category: "article",
    title: "Ayurveda and Inflammation: The Ancient Understanding of the Body's Fire",
    date: "April 12, 2026",
    excerpt: "Ayurveda maps chronic inflammation to Pitta excess. Here is the framework, the dietary inputs that drive it, and the herbs and lifestyle changes that reduce it.",
